{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>SALVO</strong> is a real-time tactical  combat simulator that puts you in  fast-paced, cinematic and intense capital ship action. You can be outnumbered, but never outgunned. With the right maneuvers, the right loadout, and your mastery of tactics, you turn impossible odds into your greatest victories. Are you ready to carve a path through fleets of enemies and bend the battlefield to your will?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Go forth and unleash devastation, commander.</i></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Fast-Paced Real-Time Tactics</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4076880/extras/67000118f3b2270206774a48b560d27c.poster.avif?t=1761739877\" aria-label=\"Multiple units in combat\" width=1170 height=494 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4076880/extras/67000118f3b2270206774a48b560d27c.webm?t=1761739877\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4076880/extras/67000118f3b2270206774a48b560d27c.mp4?t=1761739877\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In a grounded, hard sci-fi solar system\u00a0with no shields or faster-than-light travel \u2014 only steel and human ingenuity prevail. Encounters in <strong>SALVO</strong>\u00a0are lightning-fast and relentless.\u00a0Position your units to maximize firepower, exploit enemy subsystems, and chain your abilities with precision to overwhelm your foes. Success rewards sharp reflexes, clever strategy, and a deep understanding of your units' capabilities.\u00a0The battlefield is alive, and only those who think and act fast will survive.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Choose Your Path</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4076880/extras/4e3ccefdbdf3da0769e8a78778c8f031.poster.avif?t=1761739877\" width=1170 height=494 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4076880/extras/4e3ccefdbdf3da0769e8a78778c8f031.webm?t=1761739877\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4076880/extras/4e3ccefdbdf3da0769e8a78778c8f031.mp4?t=1761739877\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Story Campaign</strong> - immerse yourself in a focused, narrative-driven campaign that explores conflict, politics and survival across the solar system.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Outlaw Frontiers</strong> - venture into the lawless zones in a procedurally generated experience where every encounter is different and every choice matters.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Instant Action</strong> - jump straight into quick, standalone confrontations for  fast and satisfying combat.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Skirmish</strong> - test new ship builds, recreate epic fights, or challenge yourself against overwhelming odds? Fight your battles <i>your</i> way.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Master Your Flagship</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4076880/extras/66d2d39409d98b1ae541d17fe3e041c5.poster.avif?t=1761739877\" aria-label=\"Loadout customization in hangar\" width=1170 height=494 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4076880/extras/66d2d39409d98b1ae541d17fe3e041c5.webm?t=1761739877\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4076880/extras/66d2d39409d98b1ae541d17fe3e041c5.mp4?t=1761739877\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your flagship is more than a vessel - it's your ultimate weapon. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Do you want to fire enough missiles to blot out the stars, deliver long-range strikes that cripple enemies before they can react, or charge straight into close-range brawls where your guns tear enemies apart at point-blank range? Whatever playstyle you choose, your flagship becomes the invincible force that strikes fear into the hearts of your enemies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Be Your Own Fire Control</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4076880/extras/5ed364f028fd923fa3bb317b78c106aa.poster.avif?t=1761739877\" width=1170 height=494 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4076880/extras/5ed364f028fd923fa3bb317b78c106aa.webm?t=1761739877\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4076880/extras/5ed364f028fd923fa3bb317b78c106aa.mp4?t=1761739877\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >On a battlefield thick with electronic countermeasures, you decide when, where and how to strike. High explosive barrages tear hulls apart, armor piercing warheads smash right through armored defenses. Each launch demands skill, timing, angle. Mastering your munitions doesn't just make you effective - it makes you unstoppable.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Epic Cinematic Battles</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4076880/extras/fbb35d9ec10bf27e75631050cd744670.poster.avif?t=1761739877\" aria-label=\"Torpedo launch ultimate cinematic\" width=1170 height=494 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4076880/extras/fbb35d9ec10bf27e75631050cd744670.webm?t=1761739877\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4076880/extras/fbb35d9ec10bf27e75631050cd744670.mp4?t=1761739877\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every engagement in <strong>SALVO</strong>\u00a0is a spectacle, with cinematic cutscenes that showcase the sheer destructive potential of capital ship warfare. Unleash your most powerful abilities and watch as space itself tremble under your firepower. Light up the void with torpedo barrages, tear through enemy hulls in a storm of fire and debris. Pull off last-ditch maneuvers and scrape through the burning wreckage of your foes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Key Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dominate the Battlefield</strong>\u00a0- Intense, lightning-fast, high-stakes tactical combat.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Precision Missile Combat</strong> \u2013 Aim, fire, and annihilate with skill-based missile strikes.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Your Ship, Your Rules -</strong>\u00a0Forge your flagship into an unstoppable war machine.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Cinematic Destruction</strong> - Stylish cutscenes that capture the raw chaos of capital ship warfare.</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4076880?t=1761739877","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/app